  ($c$latte$c$, $c$Espresso with lots of hot milk and light foam. The mildest milky coffee.$c$, $c$Strong coffee in a big mug of hot milk, with a light foam on top. The mildest milky coffee: mostly milk.$c$),
  ($c$spanish_latte$c$, $c$A latte made with sweetened condensed milk. Coffee that tastes like dessert.$c$, $c$Coffee with lots of milk, sweetened with condensed milk instead of sugar. Sweet, almost like a dessert.$c$),
  ($c$mocha$c$, $c$A latte with chocolate: coffee, milk and chocolate.$c$, $c$Coffee with lots of hot milk and chocolate, often with whipped cream on top. Like a hot chocolate that tastes of coffee.$c$),
  ($c$caramel_macchiato$c$, $c$Vanilla milk with espresso on top and caramel sauce. Closer to a sweet latte.$c$, $c$Hot vanilla milk with strong coffee poured on top and a caramel drizzle. Sweet, and mostly milk.$c$),
  ($c$white_mocha$c$, $c$A mocha made with white chocolate. Very sweet.$c$, $c$Coffee with lots of milk and white chocolate, with whipped cream on top. Very sweet; the coffee is mild.$c$),
  ($c$turkish_coffee$c$, $c$The Egyptian coffee made in a small pot: plain, medium or sweet.$c$, $c$The Egyptian coffee made in a small pot with its grounds: plain, medium or sweet, in a small cup.$c$),
  ($c$french_coffee$c$, $c$Hazelnut-flavoured coffee brewed with milk. Smooth and mildly sweet.$c$, $c$Hazelnut-flavoured coffee made with milk in a small pot. Smooth, a little sweet, not bitter.$c$),
  ($c$affogato$c$, $c$A scoop of vanilla ice cream drowned in a hot espresso shot. Eaten with a spoon.$c$, $c$A scoop of vanilla ice cream with a hot strong coffee poured over it. Eaten with a spoon: half hot, half cold.$c$),
  ($c$iced_americano$c$, $c$Espresso over cold water and ice. Black iced coffee.$c$, $c$Strong coffee over cold water and ice: black iced coffee, refreshing, no milk.$c$),
  ($c$iced_latte$c$, $c$Espresso, cold milk and ice.$c$, $c$Strong coffee over cold milk and ice. Milky coffee, but cold.$c$),
  ($c$iced_spanish_latte$c$, $c$An iced latte sweetened with condensed milk.$c$, $c$Coffee with cold milk over ice, sweetened with condensed milk. Sweet and cold.$c$),
  ($c$iced_mocha$c$, $c$Iced mocha: coffee, milk and chocolate over ice.$c$, $c$Coffee, cold milk and chocolate over ice, sometimes with whipped cream on top.$c$),
  ($c$cold_brew$c$, $c$Coffee steeped in cold water for many hours. Smooth and not bitter.$c$, $c$Coffee soaked in cold water overnight instead of brewed hot. Smooth and not bitter, served over ice.$c$),
  ($c$iced_caramel_macchiato$c$, $c$Cold vanilla milk, espresso and caramel over ice.$c$, $c$Cold vanilla milk over ice, with strong coffee on top and a caramel drizzle. Sweet and cold.$c$),
  ($c$coffee_frappe$c$, $c$Coffee blended with ice and milk, like a coffee milkshake.$c$, $c$Coffee, milk and ice blended until smooth and thick, with whipped cream on top.$c$),
