  ($c$berry_smoothie$c$, $c$Berries blended with yogurt or ice. Thicker than juice.$c$, $c$Berries and banana blended with yoghurt or milk. Thicker than juice, without much ice.$c$),
  ($c$virgin_mojito$c$, $c$Lime, mint and soda over ice. In cafés it comes without alcohol.$c$, $c$Lime and mint crushed with sugar, with soda and ice. Cold and refreshing, no alcohol.$c$)
